  "en": {
    "desktop": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"100%\" style=\"height:auto\" viewBox=\"0 0 600 290\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"aolani-credit-chain-en-desktop-title aolani-credit-chain-en-desktop-desc\" xml:lang=\"en\" data-variant=\"desktop\"><title id=\"aolani-credit-chain-en-desktop-title\">Aolani’s loan in preparation</title><desc id=\"aolani-credit-chain-en-desktop-desc\">On November 17, 2026, Bloomberg reported that work was paused on a proposed 480 million US dollar loan for Aolani Cloud. DBS is mandated lead arranger and bookrunner. The loan would finance Nvidia GPUs at a Malaysian data centre, with ByteDance using the computing capacity remotely. Dashed arrows represent the planned chain as lenders assess the BIS controls announced November 16. The pause is reported by anonymous sources. Loan signing, drawdowns and the regulatory outcome are not documented in the reporting. Sources: Bloomberg and the BIS text.</desc><rect x=\".6\" y=\".6\" width=\"598.8\" height=\"288.8\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"var(--color-surface)\" stroke=\"var(--color-line-strong)\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><text x=\"18\" y=\"28\" font-family=\"l0g Nvidia Aolani Financing\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"var(--color-paper)\">Aolani’s loan in preparation</text><text x=\"18\" y=\"49\" font-family=\"l0g Nvidia Aolani Financing\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"var(--color-muted)\">USD 480m · pause reported by Bloomberg, November 17, 2026</text><g transform=\"translate(47 94)\" data-icon=\"finance\"><path d=\"M0 30 H34 M4 25 H30 M6 25 V12 M13 25 V12 M21 25 V12 M28 25 V12 M1 10 L17 1 L33 10 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-signal)\" stroke-width=\"1.25\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></g><text x=\"64\" y=\"153\" font-family=\"l0g Nvidia Aolani Financing\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"var(--color-paper)\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Lenders</text><text x=\"64\" y=\"173\" font-family=\"l0g Nvidia Aolani Financing\" font