t=\"400\" fill=\"var(--color-muted)\" text-anchor=\"middle\">DBS arranges</text><g transform=\"translate(232 80)\" data-icon=\"loan\"><path d=\"M5 0 H24 L31 7 V31 H5 Z M24 0 V7 H31 M13 13 V25 M21 13 V25\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-amber)\" stroke-width=\"1.25\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></g><text x=\"249\" y=\"133\" font-family=\"l0g Nvidia Aolani Financing\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"var(--color-paper)\" text-anchor=\"middle\">USD 480m</text><text x=\"249\" y=\"151\" font-family=\"l0g Nvidia Aolani Financing\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"var(--color-muted)\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Work paused</text><g transform=\"translate(232 185)\" data-icon=\"aolani\"><path d=\"M2 31 H32 M6 31 V10 L17 2 L28 10 V31 M11 14 H14 M20 14 H23 M11 21 H14 M20 21 H23 M13 31 V27 H21 V31\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-signal)\" stroke-width=\"1.25\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></g><text x=\"249\" y=\"238\" font-family=\"l0g Nvidia Aolani Financing\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"var(--color-paper)\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Aolani Cloud</text><text x=\"249\" y=\"256\" font-family=\"l0g Nvidia Aolani Financing\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"var(--color-muted)\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Borrower</text><g transform=\"translate(52 185)\" data-icon=\"deploy\"><path d=\"M4 0 H30 V31 H4 Z M4 10 H30 M4 21 H30 M9 5 H20 M9 15 H20 M9 26 H20 M25 5 H26 M25 15 H26 M25 26 H26\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-signal)\" stroke-width=\"1.25\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></g><text x=\"69\" y=\"238\" font-family=\"l0g Nvidia Aolani Financing\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"var(--color-paper)\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Nvidia GPUs</text><text x=\"69\" y=\"256\" font-family=\"l0g Nvidia Aolani Financing\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"var(--color-muted)\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Malaysia</text><g transform=\"translate(52 280)\" data-icon=